{"id":"128a3cd6545693f6","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-decidability.md","title":"GL Decidability","display":"df-gl-decidability — GL Decidability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-decidability","aliases":["89-df-gl-decidability"],"display":"df-gl-decidability — GL Decidability","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-theorem]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-godel-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-decidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-decidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-decidability — GL Decidability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2a8f862c318be2c\" href=\"?note=c2a8f862c318be2c\" title=\"89-df-gl-theorem\">89-df-gl-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the GL theorem set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> is an injective effective coding.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}(X)\\)</span> is the decidable-set predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里只定义 GL 定理编码集的可判定性；其成立性由后续可判定性定理\n（例如基于有限反模型搜索）证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c2a8f862c318be2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\}\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":985,"backlinks":[{"id":"09d08f3e4b6f7fbb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}$ is the decidability predicate for the\nGödel-coded GL theorem set, as defined in [[89-df-gl-decidability]]."},{"id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}$ is the predicate from\n[[89-df-gl-decidability]]."},{"id":"f0380129bd9e48f3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[89-df-consistent-pa.md]]\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded.md]]\n[[89-df-dejongh-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-diamond-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-filtration.md]]\n[[89-df-finite.md]]\n[[89-df-finite-model-property.md]]\n[[89-df-fixed-point-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[89-df-generated-submodel.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-algorithm.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-4.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-k.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-l-def.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-l.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-completeness-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-complexity.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-conservative-k4.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-consistency-proof.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-consistency.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-consistent-extension.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-countermodel.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-decidab